    "description": "<p>You enshroud yourself and your allies in darkness.</p><p>Until the start of your next turn, you and any allies within a <strong>5-space-radius</strong> of you are treated as if you have <strong>Heavy Cover</strong>.</p><p>Your <strong>Defense</strong> and <strong>Reflexes</strong> increase by <strong>+2</strong>, and you have <strong>Greater Advantage</strong> on <strong>Stealth</strong> checks to remain unseen.</p><p>Each extra success extends the duration by <strong>+1 rounds</strong>.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.4dn4CKsKPv7fkgXz]{Abyssal Darkness}</p>",
